{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"init","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"keysAndValues","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sequence","preciseIdentifier":"s:ST","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<(key","kind":"text"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Key","preciseIdentifier":"s:18OrderedCollections0A10DictionaryV3Keyxmfp","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", value","kind":"text"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Value","preciseIdentifier":"s:18OrderedCollections0A10DictionaryV5Valueq_mfp","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")>, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"uniquingKeysWith","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"combine","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Value","preciseIdentifier":"s:18OrderedCollections0A10DictionaryV5Valueq_mfp","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Value","preciseIdentifier":"s:18OrderedCollections0A10DictionaryV5Valueq_mfp","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Value","preciseIdentifier":"s:18OrderedCollections0A10DictionaryV5Valueq_mfp","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rethrows","kind":"keyword"}]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"keysAndValues","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A sequence of key-value pairs to use for the new"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"dictionary."}]}]},{"name":"combine","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A closure that is called with the values for any duplicate"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keys that are encountered. The closure returns the desired value for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the final dictionary."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You use this initializer to create a dictionary when you have a sequence"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of key-value tuples that might have duplicate keys. As the dictionary is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"built, the initializer calls the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"combine"},{"type":"text","text":" closure with the current and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"new values for any duplicate keys. Pass a closure as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"combine"},{"type":"text","text":" that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"returns the value to use in the resulting dictionary: The closure can"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"choose between the two values, combine them to produce a new value, or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"even throw an error."}]},{"syntax":null,"code":["let pairsWithDuplicateKeys = [(\"a\", 1), (\"b\", 2), (\"a\", 3), (\"b\", 4)]","","let firstValues = OrderedDictionary(","  pairsWithDuplicateKeys,","  uniquingKeysWith: { (first, _) in first })","\/\/ [\"a\": 1, \"b\": 2]","","let lastValues = OrderedDictionary(","  pairsWithDuplicateKeys,","  uniquingKeysWith: { (_, last) in last })","\/\/ [\"a\": 3, \"b\": 4]"],"type":"codeListing"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Expected O("},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}]},{"type":"text","text":") on average, where "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}]},{"type":"text","text":" is the count of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"key-value pairs, if "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Key"},{"type":"text","text":" implements high-quality hashing."}]}],"type":"aside","name":"Complexity","style":"note"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Creates a new dictionary from the key-value pairs in the given sequence,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"using a combining closure to determine the value for any duplicate keys."}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"title":"init(_:uniquingKeysWith:)","symbolKind":"init","externalID":"s:18OrderedCollections0A10DictionaryV_16uniquingKeysWithACyxq_Gqd___q_q__q_tKXEtKcSTRd__x3key_q_5valuet7ElementRtd__lufc","role":"symbol","extendedModule":"OrderedCollections","modules":[{"name":"OrderedCollections"}],"roleHeading":"Initializer","conformance":{"constraints":[{"code":"Key","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" conforms to ","type":"text"},{"code":"Hashable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"availabilityPrefix":[{"text":"Available when","type":"text"}],"conformancePrefix":[{"text":"Conforms when","type":"text"}]},"fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sequence","preciseIdentifier":"s:ST","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<(key","kind":"text"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Key","preciseIdentifier":"s:18OrderedCollections0A10DictionaryV3Keyxmfp","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", value","kind":"text"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Value","preciseIdentifier":"s:18OrderedCollections0A10DictionaryV5Valueq_mfp","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")>, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"uniquingKeysWith","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Value","preciseIdentifier":"s:18OrderedCollections0A10DictionaryV5Valueq_mfp","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Value","preciseIdentifier":"s:18OrderedCollections0A10DictionaryV5Valueq_mfp","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text"